Third-party components bundled with nbfx
========================================

Every bundled third-party artefact is listed here with its version, licence
and upstream location. The rules are in docs/plan/appendix/G-licences-and-notices.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OpenJFX (JavaFX)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version:   27 (nbfx-platform/c.gluonhq.netbeans.nbfx.lib.javafx/javafx.version)
Licence:   GNU General Public License, version 2, with the Classpath Exception
Upstream:  https://openjfx.io/ - source: https://github.com/openjdk/jfx (branch jfx27)
Module:    nbfx-platform/c.gluonhq.netbeans.nbfx.lib.javafx

Bundled files (source tree: release/modules/..., binary: nbfx-platform/modules/...):
  ext/javafx.base.jar, ext/javafx.graphics.jar, ext/javafx.controls.jar,
  ext/javafx.fxml.jar, ext/jfx.incubator.richtext.jar, ext/jfx.incubator.input.jar
  lib/*.dylib        native libraries, macOS aarch64
  lib/amd64/*.dll    native libraries, Windows x64
  lib/amd64/linux/*  native libraries, Linux x64

javafx.web (WebKit) and javafx.media are NOT bundled.

Licence texts (source tree: .../lib.javafx/release/legal/javafx/,
binary: nbfx-platform/legal/javafx/):
  LICENSE                  GPLv2 with the Classpath Exception
  ADDITIONAL_LICENSE_INFO  how the Classpath Exception applies
  ASSEMBLY_EXCEPTION       OpenJDK assembly exception
  gcc.md                   GCC runtime library (Linux natives)
  jpeg_fx.md               Independent JPEG Group (javafx.graphics)
  mesa3d.md                Mesa 3-D (javafx.graphics, Linux)
  pipewire.md              PipeWire (javafx.graphics, Linux)
  unicode-fx.md            Unicode data (jfx.incubator.richtext)

The corresponding source code of the OpenJFX modules is available from the
upstream repository above, branch jfx27.

